{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by me, myself, and I. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you use a lens to split light, like chromatic aberration. This makes it possible to make a large variety of simple or complex puzzles. You can also use lenses to block out certain colors of light, you can also use two colored lenses at the same time for more flexibility. The player character is also made of more than one part, which allows for more complicated levels where you need to get the same color to two different locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can complete every level.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4121690?t=1763761562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121690/dc1af3c36534e90b6b9c226eba48fd0bf1f84075/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763761562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121690/1b6a499f08882665b384ef4350a52d59af791923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763761562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4121690/1b6a499f08882665b384ef4350a52d59af791923/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763761562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4195510,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was developed by me, myself, and I. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game you use a lens to split light, like chromatic aberration. This makes it possible to make a large variety of simple or complex puzzles. You can also use lenses to block out certain colors of light, you can also use two colored lenses at t